attn: ...and all four signatures differ, so they are four different defects
attn: the backward kernel exists and this harness grades it against
      attentionBackward, but it is NOT on the training path: src/model.zig's
      cuda_attn routes the FORWARD through this file, and nothing in the Zig
      tree calls device.Attn.backward, so the backward kernel is exercised
      only here. A KV cache exists (src/kv_cache.zig, six tests) and
      src/decode.zig decodes through it: decode.cudaAttnStep derives q_offset =
      pos from the cache itself, so the forward kernel's offset is exercised at
      every real decode position and not only at 0.
